  "markdown": "Where we work\n\n# Wallpaper installation in Chelsea\n\nHouses and apartments in Chelsea, SW3 and SW10. Hand-painted papers, grasscloth, silk, fabric walling and murals, from the survey to the return visit.\n\n[Request a quotation](https://www.mrwallcover.com/contact/) [See the work](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/)\n\nChelsea work is mostly private houses, and we do not name them. What carries across from our hotel work is the method: a written scope by room, the same core team throughout, and a contained, tidy work area in a house that is still lived in.\n\nPreparation is part of the scope where it is specified: stripping old paper, sanding with dust extraction, and making good before anything decorative goes up. Some papers are hung over a lining. Some, including certain murals, are specified without one.\n\nAftercare is included. About four to six weeks after completion we come back to check seams, edges and corners once the paper has settled, and the workmanship carries a twelve-month guarantee.\n\n![Penny Morrison showroom at 9 Langton Street, with floral wallpaper, a marble fireplace and upholstered seating.](https://www.mrwallcover.com/media/img/penny-morrison-showroom-01.jpg)\n\nOur work in Chelsea: the finished [Penny Morrison showroom](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/penny-morrison-showroom/), with green joinery, floral wallpaper and displayed lampshades.Photograph: Mr Wallcover.\n\n## On the public record\n\n[![Penny Morrison showroom at 9 Langton Street, with floral wallpaper, a marble fireplace and upholstered seating.](https://www.mrwallcover.com/media/img/penny-morrison-showroom-01.jpg)](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/penny-morrison-showroom/)\n\nPenny Morrison showroom at 9 Langton Street, with floral wallpaper, a marble fireplace and upholstered seating.Photograph: Mr Wallcover.\n\n### [Penny Morrison showroom, Chelsea](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/penny-morrison-showroom/)\n\nAll the internal works plus the full exterior, 2023–2024.\n\n[View the project](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/penny-morrison-showroom/)\n\nQuestions\n\n## Asked about Chelsea\n\nIllustrative material studies\n\nPause motion\n\n### Will you take on a single room in Chelsea?\n\nYes. We focus on whole residences and hotel packages, and will take on one- or two-room commissions. We give a date after the survey.\n\n### What happens after the paper is hung?\n\nWe return about four to six weeks after completion, at no call-out charge, to look at seams, edges and corners. The workmanship guarantee lasts twelve months from completion.\n\nBy [Dorin Burcus](https://www.mrwallcover.com/about/#dorin), founder · Last reviewed 9 October 2026\n",
